#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Natural-born" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while but didn't entirely abandon human civilization, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe"
" some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""

