#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Temporal Misadventure" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/scenario.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysmic portal storms, you and several other people were lost "
"trying to escape the monsters attacking you.  Eventually, something caught "
"up, and as your fellows started turning into frozen statues you ran straight "
"into what should have been open air.  The pain of that impact was nothing "
"compared to the knife you suddenly found stabbed into your torso.  The most "
"you saw of your attacker was a quick blur before everything suddenly changed."
"  Snow covers the ground, the sun has set, you are freezing cold, and the "
"knife is still stuck in your torso.  However, you've gained a dramatic new "
"sense of time, and what is definitely the beginning of the ability to "
"manipulate it.  Even beyond the knife and the winter you never thought you'd "
"have to prepare for, your new powers tell you that there is much more wrong "
"with you than is immediately apparent.  Hopefully you can use your skills and"
" powers to survive both your new condition and every other horror of the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

